le\":\"Whiplash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Under the direction of a ruthless instructor, a talented young drummer begins to pursue perfection at any cost, even his humanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9963,\"title\":\"Premonition\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vKW1XIYrIqVrbCaYj9FQDHKXR8R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/esXYvlivZ8j0HGqob949CIjqnGi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A depressed housewife who learns her husband was killed in a car accident the day previously awakens the next morning to find him alive and well at home, and then awakens the day after to a world in which he is still dead.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9674,\"title\":\"Ring 0\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nuhEWlaoMD00rTDCiYxdEc7d1tD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/noRX8VyyAFK1tt0DQSq5qy1tE10.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Taking place thirty years before the events of Ringu, Ringu 0 provides the shocking background story of how the girl on the video became a deadly, vengeful spirit.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":290098,\"title\":\"The Handmaiden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2b3RNXF7ca9bgX8FrjRBYfLnNQC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sook-hee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475557,\"title\":\"Joker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/udDclJoHjfjb8Ekgsd4FDteOkCU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlay2M5QYvi6igbGcFjq8jxeusY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the 1980s, a failed stand-up comedian is driven insane and turns to a life of crime and chaos in Gotham City while becoming an infamous psychopathic crime figure.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":210577,\"title\":\"Gone Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ts996lKsxvjkO2yiYG0ht4qAicO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iWak7wT0j6ycCc8lKr4NBz9c7n5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With his wife's disappearance having become the focus of an intense media circus, a man sees the spotlight turned on him when it's suspected that he may not be innocent.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1010581,\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister's mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"-Ep4dKwQQqg\",\"name\":\"Saayavanam Trailer | Damor Cinema | Santhosh Damodharan | Anil Kumar.\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}